            "text": "theorem sum_G_le {q A C : ℝ} (hq : 0 < q) (hA : 0 ≤ A) (hC : 0 ≤ C) {u₁ : ℝ} {m : ℕ}\n    (hu₁ : 1 ≤ u₁) (hlast : u₁ + m - 1 ≤ q / 2) :\n    ∑ i ∈ Finset.range m, min A (C * fq q (u₁ + i)) ≤ 2 * (q / π) * √(A * C) :=",
